# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000014> (radiation therapy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "NCIT:C15313") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000014> "Treatment of a disease by means of exposure of the target or the whole body to radiation. Radiation therapy is often used as part of curative therapy and occasionally as a component of palliative treatment for cancer. Other uses include total body irradiation prior to transplantation.")
